## 数据库 SQL

先建立数据库：

```sql
CREATE DATABASE school_register;

USE school_register;
```

然后：

### user

```sql
CREATE TABLE user(
    id INT PRIMARY KEY AUTO_INCREMENT,
    username VARCHAR(50),
    password VARCHAR(100),
    role VARCHAR(20)
);
```

插入管理员：

```sql
INSERT INTO user(username,password,role)
VALUES('admin','123456','admin');
```

---

### student

```sql
CREATE TABLE student(
    id INT PRIMARY KEY AUTO_INCREMENT,
    student_no VARCHAR(30),
    name VARCHAR(50),
    gender VARCHAR(10),
    age INT,
    phone VARCHAR(20),
    email VARCHAR(100)
);
```

---

### course

```sql
CREATE TABLE course(
    id INT PRIMARY KEY AUTO_INCREMENT,
    course_name VARCHAR(100),
    teacher VARCHAR(50),
    credit INT
);
```

---

### registration

```sql
CREATE TABLE registration(
    id INT PRIMARY KEY AUTO_INCREMENT,
    student_id INT,
    course_id INT,
    register_time DATETIME
);
```

